/// Definition: Case manager KPIs per fortnight for CYF case managers: clients, employees, payroll, shifts and schedules, from the fortnightly case manager KPI table in L4_Analytical (selected columns). One row per case manager, area and fortnight.
/// For analysis: Pre-aggregated in the warehouse. Group by DimCaseManagers, DimArea and DimDate through Fortnight Start Date.
table FactCMFortnightlySnapshot
	lineageTag: b619b5bb-f738-47f5-9f04-e9a9255d3fa6

	/// Definition: Date the fortnight starts.
	/// For analysis: Key: joins DimDate Date; group by DimDate period columns.
	column 'Fortnight Start Date'
